.TH NEO-MESSAGING-SMS 1 "2026-11-10" "gnome-phone 0.1.0" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-messaging-sms \- SMS service of GNOME Phone messaging
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-messaging-sms
.SH DESCRIPTION
Takes text messages off the modem through ModemManager, stores and notifies them, and sends messages, with the messaging app closed. It runs as the systemd user service neo-messaging-sms.service and owns de.yesman.Messaging.Sms on the session bus.
.SH SEE ALSO
neo-messaging(1), ModemManager(8)
